youranmod.jei.trichlorosilane.info=Purity is counted in nines, stored in the fluid's NBT and shown after its name (1 nine = 90%, 3 nines = 99.9%). Trichlorosilane without a purity tag counts as 1 nine (a pipe or tank that drops the tag is treated as dirty). Trichlorosilane of different purities cannot share a tank; a leftover under 10 mB in a still is distilled on its own after a while (90%, rounded down). One distillation pass in a Solar Distiller or Distillation Tower turns every 10 mB into 9 mB and adds one nine (up to 32).
youranmod.jei.ore_washing_wafer=Ore Washing Plant: Wafers
youranmod.jei.ore_washing_wafer.note=Water purity %s%% (scrap, 9-nine wafers)
youranmod.jei.ore_washing_wafer.scrap=gold cast %s, clay cast %s
youranmod.jei.trichlorosilane_hydrogen.info=Trichlorosilane-hydrogen mixture is made from trichlorosilane of at least 9 nines and hydrogen (IC2), in an Immersive Engineering Refinery (10 mB + 40 mB -> 50 mB per tick) or a Tinkers' Smeltery (1 mB + 4 mB -> 5 mB). It keeps the purity of the trichlorosilane (stored in NBT, shown after its name). 1000 mB poured into a doped wafer cast makes one silicon wafer (Tinkers' Casting Table, IC2 Canner in enrich mode, IE Bottling Machine).
youranmod.jei.wafer.info=A silicon wafer keeps the purity of the mixture it was cast from and whether the cast was gold or clay. Wash it in an IC2 Ore Washing Plant (1000 mB of water each) to get a precision wafer (same purity and cast) or a scrapped one. Scrap chance = (1 - water purity) x cast factor (gold 1, clay 1.5) x 0.8^(nines - 9), capped at 100%; wafers under 9 nines are always scrapped. See "Ore Washing Plant: Wafers" for each water.
youranmod.jei.scrap_wafer.info=A wafer ruined in washing. Smelt it in a furnace or an Immersive Engineering Arc Furnace back into an Alchemistry silicon ingot and start the silicon line again.
youranmod.jei.naphthalene.info=Naphthalene: white flaky crystals. Each 100 mB of creosote (Immersive Engineering or IC2) distilled in an Immersive Petroleum distillation tower has a 10% chance of dropping one, besides the arene and cresol. More than 32 in your inventory (armor slots not counted) makes you nauseous every second; the more you carry, the longer and stronger it gets.
